---
const without = [
  'Fifty disconnected SaaS tools, each with its own login',
  'Identity scattered across every vendor directory',
  'Audit trails that don\'t reconcile across systems',
  'Access governance debt nobody owns',
  'Half a dozen support contracts at 2am',
  'Compliance posture only as strong as the weakest vendor',
];

const withG8 = [
  'One integrated platform, one operations model',
  'One identity model across every product',
  'One unified audit trail that actually reconciles',
  'Joiner-mover-leaver wired across the whole suite',
  'One accountable partnership — one contract, one SLA',
  'Compliance posture shared by every product',
];

// The "With g8suite" panel mirrors the sprawl diagram: the same boxes, now
// aligned into one calm grid. Order, not chaos — no labels, no central funnel.
const orderedCols = 7;
const orderedRows = 2;
---

<section id="problem" class="section">
  <div class="container-page">
    <header class="max-w-4xl">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">The problem</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.1] text-body sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Most organisations don't have a software problem.<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        They have a software <span class="text-brass">sprawl</span> problem.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Two decades of procurement-led tool adoption left regulated organisations with seams nobody owns and a compliance posture that's only as strong as the weakest vendor on the stack.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-8">
      <article class="relative overflow-hidden border border-line bg-card p-7 lg:p-9">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-faint">
            <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line-strong">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M2 2l6 6M8 2l-6 6" stroke-linecap="round" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            Without g8suite
          </p>
          <span class="text-sm text-faint">Today's reality</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-body">Tool sprawl, vendor sprawl, audit sprawl</h3>

        <svg viewBox="0 0 360 160" class="mt-6 h-auto w-full text-faint" aria-hidden="true">
          <g class="stroke-current" stroke-width="1" fill="none">
            {[...Array(20).keys()].map((i) => {
              const x1 = (i * 17 + 10) % 340 + 10;
              const y1 = (i * 41) % 130 + 15;
              const x2 = ((i + 7) * 19) % 340 + 10;
              const y2 = ((i + 3) * 37) % 130 + 15;
              return <line x1={x1} y1={y1} x2={x2} y2={y2} stroke-dasharray="2 3" opacity="0.4" />;
            })}
          </g>
          <g class="fill-soft stroke-current" stroke-width="1">
            {[...Array(14).keys()].map((i) => {
              const x = (i * 27 + 18) % 340 + 8;
              const y = (i * 43) % 130 + 15;
              return <rect x={x} y={y} width="32" height="18" rx="2" />;
            })}
          </g>
        </svg>

        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          {without.map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-faint" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8" stroke-linecap="round" />
              </svg>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="relative overflow-hidden border-2 border-brass/40 bg-card-2 p-7 lg:p-9">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-brass">
            <span class="inline-flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-green/15 text-green">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M2 5.5l2 2L8 3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
            </span>
            With g8suite
          </p>
          <span class="text-sm text-muted">One platform</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-body">One platform. One audit. One partnership.</h3>

        <svg viewBox="0 0 360 160" class="mt-6 h-auto w-full" aria-hidden="true">
          <g class="fill-brass/10 stroke-brass" stroke-width="1">
            {[...Array(orderedCols * orderedRows).keys()].map((i) => {
              const col = i % orderedCols;
              const row = Math.floor(i / orderedCols);
              const x = 29 + col * 45;
              const y = 51 + row * 42;
              return <rect x={x} y={y} width="32" height="18" rx="2" />;
            })}
          </g>
        </svg>

        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
          {withG8.map((item) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body">
              <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0 text-green" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3 8l3.5 3.5L13 4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              </svg>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border-l-2 border-brass bg-brass/[0.06] p-7 lg:p-8">
      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-body lg:text-lg">
        The answer is not more integrations. The answer is consolidation on a platform built for sovereignty from the ground up.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
